WEBVTT

1
00:01:10.112 --> 00:01:11.212
song It is time to sleep.

2
00:01:25.657 --> 00:01:32.719
The pals have Look!

3
00:01:33.760 --> 00:01:35.040
Pink drives a jeep.

4
00:01:39.980 --> 00:01:40.260
Beep! Beep!

5
00:01:40.300 --> 00:01:41.762
The jeep drives fast.

6
00:01:50.092 --> 00:01:52.215
Oh! Yellow has a pretty dress.

7
00:01:54.077 --> 00:01:55.679
She has a pretty cape too.

8
00:01:55.699 --> 00:02:16.964
Yellow: It is time for tea.

9
00:02:16.984 --> 00:02:18.706
Look! Red is in the sea.

10
00:02:20.768 --> 00:02:23.270
Red: This is a nice sea.

11
00:02:30.476 --> 00:02:31.637
plays with seals.

12
00:02:41.205 --> 00:02:43.768
Yum! Blue has ice cream.

13
00:02:45.428 --> 00:02:47.429
Blue: I love ice cream.

14
00:02:51.252 --> 00:02:52.353
Here comes a bee!

15
00:02:57.156 --> 00:02:57.556
Oh no!

16
00:02:58.036 --> 00:02:58.937
A bad dream!

17
00:03:02.799 --> 00:03:04.340
Now Blue sleeps again.

18
00:03:08.763 --> 00:03:09.624
Sweet dreams!
